                <pb facs="0551" n="457" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg457"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.20/316: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Carter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-02-26T12:00:00-05:00">February 26,
                        1930—noon</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>22. Your 28, February 22, 3 p.m. You may inform the Liberian Government that the
                    United States Government withdraws the nomination of Captain Outley as made
                    under the 1912 Loan Agreement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
